+// v127 note: an earlier attempt exposed the old libbase ABI through a separate
+// vendor shared library ("libbase_abi_shim") LD_PRELOAD-ed by the affected
+// service rc files. That does not work: vndksupport dlopens vendor HALs inside
+// the "(default)" linker namespace, and a shim living in /vendor/lib64 is not
+// reachable from there:
+//   WARNING: linker: library "/vendor/lib64/libbase_abi_shim.so" is not
+//   accessible for the namespace: [name="(default)", ...]
+// so the symbols have to be compiled into libbase itself (see the "libbase"
+// module above). The module is gone; do not reintroduce it.
+
